//- Releases page: latest APP version info from GitHub Releases API
- const repoUrl = 'https://github.com/tghyscifi/tghyscifi.github.io'

.page-body.markdown
  != page.content

#releases-info.releases-info
  .releases-loading
    span= __('loading')
  .releases-error(hidden)
    p 抱歉，暂时无法获取最新版本信息，请稍后再试。
    a.releases-btn(href=repoUrl + '/releases' target='_blank' rel='noopener') 前往 GitHub Releases 查看
  .releases-card(hidden)
    .releases-card-head
      .releases-tag-row
        span#releases-badge.releases-badge 最新版本
        span#releases-version.releases-tag
      h3#releases-title.releases-title
      .releases-meta
        span#releases-published.releases-date
    .releases-body#releases-body
    .releases-assets#releases-assets
    .releases-foot
      a#releases-html-link.releases-btn(href='#' target='_blank' rel='noopener') 在 GitHub 查看此版本
      a.releases-btn.releases-btn-ghost(href=repoUrl + '/releases' target='_blank' rel='noopener') 查看全部版本